OL,3,GNEWSABusy city street 'transformed' by
OL,4,A#6m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre street has been
OL,7,F"transformed" by a multi-million pound
OL,8,Frevamp.
OL,10,FVictoria Street, between Temple Gate
OL,11,Fand Bristol Bridge in Bristol, has a
OL,12,Fnew two-way cycle path separated from
OL,13,Fboth traffic and pedestrians, along
OL,14,Fwith wider pavements and improvements
OL,15,Fto bus stops.
OL,17,FBristol City Council said the #6.2m
OL,18,Fscheme was part of wider efforts to
OL,19,Fencourage more people to walk, cycle
OL,20,Fand use public transport, while helping
OL,21,Fto reduce congestion and improve air
OL,22,Fquality.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
