OL,3,GNEWSABusy city street 'transformed' by
OL,4,A#6m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Ed Plowden, chair of the
OL,7,Fcouncil's transport and connectivity
OL,8,Fcommittee, said: "Victoria Street has
OL,9,Fbeen transformed into a greener, more
OL,10,Fwelcoming route through the heart of
OL,11,Fthe city."
